&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/newsweek-top-100-global-most-loved-workplaces-2023&quot;&gt;Newsweek&#39;s Top 100 Global Most Loved Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt; to help shape the shared experiences and systems that connect Hudl&#39;s products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hudl is bringing together products used across sports, teams and organizations into a more connected platform. That creates design problems that don&#39;t always fit neatly within a single feature or product: how information is structured, how common workflows behave across products, how video and data work together, and how emerging technologies like AI change the way people interact with Hudl.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work within Core UX, the team responsible for the design foundations that help Hudl&#39;s products feel clear, consistent and connected. Our work includes shared patterns and experiences, information architecture, video and data, and the systems that help product teams build at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve connected problems.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll work on experiences that cross features, products and workflows, considering how individual design decisions fit into the broader Hudl platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make complexity easier to understand.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll turn complicated workflows, information and technical constraints into experiences that feel clear and intuitive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work across teams.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll partner with product, engineering and other designers to understand problems, explore solutions and help create experiences that can work at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design from evidence.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll learn directly from customers, use research and product data to inform your work, and test and iterate on ideas as you go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your work through delivery.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll independently run scoped design projects, working from early exploration through implementation and measuring how well the solution works once it&#39;s shipped.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For this role, we&#39;re currently considering candidates who are within commuting distance of our offices in London, but we&#39;re also open to remote candidates in the U.K.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong product design craft.&lt;/strong&gt; You can turn complex requirements into clear, intuitive experiences through strong interaction and visual design. You know how to choose the right methods and level of fidelity for the problem, moving between exploration, prototyping and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems thinking.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re comfortable working through ambiguity, naturally look for connections, and consider how a solution might affect other workflows, users or parts of a product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative communication.&lt;/strong&gt; You can explain your thinking, seek out feedback and work through different perspectives with product, engineering and design partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer and evidence focus.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re comfortable talking with customers and using research, product data and other evidence to make and evaluate design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluency.&lt;/strong&gt; You actively use AI tools in your design process and are curious about how AI changes the products we design. You&#39;re comfortable experimenting with emerging interaction patterns and thinking critically about where AI can improve an experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong portfolio.&lt;/strong&gt; You can show how you&#39;ve worked through product problems, including your reasoning, collaboration and iteration rather than only the final solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with complex or connected products.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve designed experiences that span multiple workflows, surfaces or parts of a larger product, and understand how individual design decisions contribute to a cohesive experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with data-rich or technical products.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve designed products involving complex data, analytics, video or other technically challenging workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with design systems or information architecture.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve worked with shared patterns, design systems, information architecture or other foundations that help experiences scale across a product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI product design experience.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve designed conversational, agentic or other AI-powered experiences and have explored emerging interaction patterns beyond traditional interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We’ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time, company-wide holidays and timeout (meeting-free) days, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you’ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We’re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We’ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you’re at the office or working remotely, we’ll provide you the tech stack and hardware to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your mental and physical health&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We care about our employees’ wellbeing. Our Employee Assistance Program, employee resource groups and fitness partner Peerfit have you covered.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cover your medical&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;insurance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We have multiple plans to pick from to ensure you’ll have the coverage you (and your dependents) want, including vision, dental, fertility healthcare and family forming benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to your 401(K)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. Yep, that’s free money. We’ll match up to 4% of your own contribution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is displayed below—&lt;strong&gt;starting salaries will typically fall near the middle of this range.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make compensation decisions based on an individual&#39;s experience, skills and education in line with our internal pay equity practices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£51,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£86,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at Hudl&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hudl is an equal opportunity employer. Through our actions, behaviors and attitude, we’ll create an environment where everyone, no matter their differences, feels like they belong.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer resources to ensure our employees feel safe bringing their authentic selves to work, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/about-inclusion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;including employee resource groups and communities&lt;/a&gt;. But we recognize there’s ongoing work to be done, which is why we track our efforts and commitments in &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/about-inclusion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;annual inclusion reports&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We also know imposter syndrome is real and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theatlantic.com/magazine/archive/2014/05/the-confidence-gap/359815/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;confidence gap&lt;/a&gt; can get in the way of meeting spectacular candidates. Please don’t hesitate to apply—we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Senior Maintenance Manager (all genders)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be responsible for ensuring the reliable and efficient operation of our highly automated production facilities at our &lt;strong&gt;Barleben site near Magdeburg&lt;/strong&gt;. Together with your Engineering team, you will ensure that our technical equipment remains safe, reliable, and available at all times.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Production, Supply Chain, and Engineering, you will develop future-oriented maintenance strategies, optimize technical processes, and create the conditions for smooth and efficient production. Through your leadership, technical expertise, and passion for Operational Excellence, you will make a significant contribution to the success of our production site.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead, develop, and inspire a team of Maintenance Supervisors, Automation Engineers, and Technicians while fostering a culture of collaboration, safety, and continuous improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Take ownership of the technical availability and reliability of our production equipment by continuously developing and optimizing our maintenance strategy to sustainably minimize downtime.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor and analyze key performance indicators (KPIs), including equipment availability, maintenance costs, and technical efficiency, and translate insights into impactful improvement initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Plan and coordinate preventive and corrective maintenance activities to ensure reliable, efficient, and cost-effective plant operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate closely with Production, Supply Chain, Engineering, and Procurement to develop technical solutions that continuously improve production performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the implementation and commissioning of new production equipment and automation solutions while ensuring compliance with all safety, quality, and regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage external service providers and suppliers, building long-term, trusted partnerships that support operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive the professional and personal development of your team while fostering a high-performance, motivating work environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure compliance with all legal requirements and internal standards related to occupational health and safety, food safety, quality, and compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyze technical failures, implement sustainable root-cause solutions, and lead cross-functional improvement and capital investment projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actively contribute to cross-site projects and strategic initiatives, helping shape the future development of our production network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Mechanical Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Automation Engineering, Mechatronics, or a comparable technical discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Several years of experience in maintenance or technical management within a manufacturing environment, ideally in the food, beverage, or FMCG industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven leadership experience with a passion for developing, coaching, and motivating high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong expertise in maintenance management as well as the maintenance and optimization of automated production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with KPI management, project management, and the successful implementation of Operational Excellence and Continuous Improvement initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong analytical, structured, and solution-oriented mindset combined with a hands-on approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to explain technical topics clearly to a wide range of stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office; experience with Google Workspace and Dematic automation systems is considered an advantage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid knowledge of relevant occupational health and safety, food safety, quality, and compliance standards and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent organizational skills and the ability to prioritize effectively in a dynamic production environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Passion for Operational Excellence, technical innovation, and the continuous development of people and processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluency in German and good written and spoken English skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A modern workplace at an innovative and growing production site in &lt;strong&gt;Barleben near Magdeburg&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A motivated team with short decision-making paths and plenty of room to make an impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Attractive discounts on HelloFresh meal kits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comprehensive learning and development opportunities through internal training and personalized development programs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A structured onboarding program to ensure a successful start.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A competitive compensation package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;30 days of annual leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Subsidized Germany Ticket (Deutschlandticket).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Company pension scheme.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discounted fitness memberships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;High-quality personal protective equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regular team events and many additional employee benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Hungry for More?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Then we&#39;d love to hear from you! Please submit your application &lt;strong&gt;without a photo and without providing information about your nationality, gender, or other personal characteristics.&lt;/strong&gt; You are, of course, welcome to voluntarily include language certificates as well as proof of your residence and work permit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We look forward to getting to know you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#JD1001&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#barnmaintenance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-top.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What we do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;RELEX Solutions delivers a unified supply chain planning platform for retailers and manufacturers, enabled by proven AI technology. We help companies optimize demand forecasting, replenishment, merchandising, pricing and promotions, supply chain operations, and production planning across the end-to-end value chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a global team of over 2,000 professionals, we work side-by-side with our customers to solve real problems with lasting impact. Companies trust RELEX to increase product availability, boost sales, deliver actionable insights, improve sustainability, and drive profitable growth. Join us and make an impact on the world and your career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In response to our fast growth and market expansion, we are looking for a Forward Deployed Engineer to join our Merchandising team in [NEEDS INPUT: location].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Merchandising is where retailers decide what to sell, where, and at what price. Those decisions ripple out into less waste, better-stocked shelves, and fairer pricing for millions of shoppers. A Forward Deployed Engineer (FDE) is embedded directly in the customer&#39;s environment to make that happen: configuring, extending and building on the RELEX platform against one customer&#39;s real operational context. Where our product engineers build one capability for every customer, you work the other way round, one customer and many capabilities, until their supply chain measurably runs better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role is embedded by design. You&#39;ll spend meaningful stretches of an engagement on-site with customers, heaviest around discovery and go-live, so willingness to travel is a condition of the role rather than an occasional extra.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we need you to do and be&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring your ideas. Challenge ours. Grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical delivery end to end, from discovery through go-live: configuration, extensions, integrations, and the quality of everything that ships into the customer&#39;s instance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prove the value you deliver by instrumenting deployments, measuring outcomes against the customer&#39;s baseline, and presenting the evidence credibly to operational users and executives alike&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical customer relationship, learning their operations deeply enough to challenge requirements and become their first call when a new problem appears&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed the product by capturing gaps and use cases from the field and prototyping solutions that can graduate into the RELEX roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build customer self-sufficiency through knowledge transfer and clean handovers, so they can operate and extend RELEX without you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow the account by surfacing adjacent use cases, new sites and unused capabilities, and shaping the technical solution and value case together with pre-sales and the account team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support commercial activity with feasibility assessments, proofs of concept and technical demos, so what gets agreed is technically grounded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the table&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our five values are our playbook. We speak up when things don&#39;t make sense. We stop doing what doesn&#39;t add value. We stay curious, back each other up, and make space for both innovation and laughter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing and building software across the full stack, in production, not just in dev&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of system design, observability, and hypothesis-driven development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building integrations for downstream or customer-facing systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid working knowledge of cloud platforms and modern application stacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen: you can translate technical work into measurable financial impact and communicate it clearly to a non-technical audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable managing ambiguity and taking full ownership of outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel and to work on-site at customer locations for parts of an engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using AI in your everyday work and developing AI tool adoption as an organizational strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in written and spoken English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: exposure to retail, merchandising, or pricing and promotions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;More important: you learn a new domain and a new codebase fast, and you&#39;re comfortable being productive before you feel fully up to speed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer in return&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be supported and given the space to thrive. We offer meaningful work, flexibility, and a culture that backs you to share your voice and be authentic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An international career and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A rapidly growing and financially robust software company with exciting opportunities for career growth, also in the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;RELEX key benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility in how and where you work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Room to thrive in a fast-growing global company with a good market position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical benefits that support work, family, wellness, and everyday life&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diverse, inclusive, and supportive work culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work that meaningfully reduces waste and improves sustainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership, autonomy and flat hierarchies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two paid volunteering days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a global community of different cultures, voices, and experiences. We celebrate what makes us unique and connect through what we share, in an authentic and safe environment. Together we shape the future, and each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that to be considered for this position, you must be fluent in English, and hold a valid work permit for the country you reside in / will work in. We&#39;re excited to connect with applicants who meet these criteria and share our passion to do hard things, trust each other, and build what&#39;s next for the product, the planet, and the people.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-bottom.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Analytics Manager to take ownership of our UK &amp;amp; EU analytics strategy and reporting ecosystem - ensuring that the insights driving our commercial, product, and operational decisions are accurate, timely, and deeply actionable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be hands-on with SQL, Python, dbt, and modern BI platforms, building data models, designing self-serve analytics, and translating complex data into strategic business recommendations. This is a technical leadership role managing three direct reports to start, offering the opportunity to shape how insights empower teams across our international operations. You will be accountable for Analytics operating as a proactive decision partner, setting priorities, developing the team, and ensuring analytical capacity is directed toward the highest-value business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the UK &amp;amp; EU analytics strategy - &lt;/strong&gt;Set the analytical agenda, priorities and operating model, ensuring the team focuses on the decisions and opportunities with the greatest business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with senior leadership - &lt;/strong&gt;Act as a trusted analytical partner to UK and European leaders, proactively identifying risks, opportunities and questions where data can materially improve an outcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create clarity around business performance - &lt;/strong&gt;Establish a consistent view across acquisition, conversion, retention and revenue, moving quickly from what changed, to why it changed, to what the business should do next.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop a high-performing team - &lt;/strong&gt;Manage and coach a team of analysts, creating clear ownership, developing independent problem-solvers, and setting a high bar for analytical rigour, communication and commercial impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive prioritisation and accountability - &lt;/strong&gt;Balance competing stakeholder demands, make explicit trade-offs, and distinguish genuine capacity constraints from work that should be simplified, automated, self-served or stopped.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable, trusted analytics - &lt;/strong&gt;Drive common metric definitions, decision-focused dashboards, semantic models and self-service capabilities so teams can answer more questions independently and analytical impact can scale without linear headcount growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support European growth - &lt;/strong&gt;Ensure new products, brands and markets launch with clear success metrics, leading indicators, diagnostic views and measurement plans, while reusing common approaches rather than rebuilding analytics market by market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner across the global data organisation - &lt;/strong&gt;Work closely with Analytics, Data Engineering, Data Platform and other Hims &amp;amp; Hers data leaders to align definitions, standards and reusable capabilities, avoiding local duplication where global solutions already exist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Increase leverage through AI - &lt;/strong&gt;Use AI and modern analytics tooling to accelerate analysis, improve self-service and shift analyst time toward judgement, diagnosis and higher-value decision support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience - &lt;/strong&gt;7-8+ years of experience in data analytics, BI, or product analytics roles, including at least 2 years of direct team management experience. You have operated as the accountable analytics partner for a business area, market or senior leadership group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong analytical foundations - &lt;/strong&gt;You are technically credible, with advanced SQL and sufficient statistical and analytical depth to challenge senior analytical work, unpack the methodology and identify when a conclusion is not supported by the evidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and product judgement - &lt;/strong&gt;You can turn broad business questions into structured analytical frameworks and connect findings to business economics, customer behaviour and consequential decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive stakeholder influence - &lt;/strong&gt;You have a track record of building trust with senior leaders, constructively challenging requests and assumptions, and influencing decisions rather than simply supplying analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People leadership - &lt;/strong&gt;You have developed strong analysts, set clear expectations, raised performance standards and handled difficult performance or prioritisation decisions when required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent prioritisation - &lt;/strong&gt;You create clarity in ambiguous, fast-moving environments and are comfortable saying no, not yet, or there is a better way when demand exceeds capacity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builder mindset - &lt;/strong&gt;You improve the system around the team through common definitions, reusable analysis, self-service, tooling and clear ownership rather than solving every problem with another dashboard or additional headcount.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern analytics experience -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;You are comfortable with modern warehouses, transformation tooling and BI platforms such as BigQuery, dbt and Sigma/Looker or equivalents. You understand semantic modelling and data quality well enough to partner effectively with engineering teams, but this is an Analytics leadership role rather than a Data Engineering role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forward-looking approach - &lt;/strong&gt;You understand how AI and automation are changing Analytics and have a pragmatic view of where they can materially increase team and stakeholder leverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;UK and European leadership see Analytics as part of how they run the business, not a service they call after a question appears.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your team understands the decisions its stakeholders are making, catches important changes early, explains their drivers clearly and influences what happens next. At the same time, you are building an analytics model that scales across markets through common definitions, trusted data, effective self-service and strong integration with the wider Hims &amp;amp; Hers data organisation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking an experienced Enterprise Account Executive to drive adoption of Anthropic&#39;s AI solutions across the life sciences sector throughout EMEA. In this role, you&#39;ll leverage your deep understanding of the pharmaceutical and biotech ecosystem to help organizations accelerate drug discovery, optimize clinical operations, and bring treatments to patients faster through responsible AI implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop and execute strategic sales plans to drive adoption of Anthropic&#39;s AI solutions within large pharmaceutical, biotech, and medical device organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and maintain relationships with key decision-makers at global pharma companies, specialty biotechs, and CROs across EMEA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with our HCLS Applied AI team to articulate technical capabilities and develop compelling value propositions for life sciences-specific applications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identify and qualify new opportunities through discovery calls, demonstrations, and collaborative problem-solving sessions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Navigate complex enterprise buying processes within large pharma organizations, negotiate contracts, and close strategic deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leverage our strategic partnerships to expand our reach in the life sciences market&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Monitor and report on sales pipeline, market trends, and competitive landscape&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capture and communicate industry-specific requirements to inform product development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent Anthropic at life sciences industry events and conferences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally to ensure our solutions address pharma-specific challenges around data privacy, security, and regulatory compliance — including EU AI Act considerations and EMA guidance on AI in medicines development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You may be a good fit if you have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8+ years of enterprise sales experience within the EMEA market, with at least 5 years selling technology solutions into large pharmaceutical, biotech, or medical device companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven track record of exceeding quota and closing complex enterprise deals with global pharma or specialty biotech organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep understanding of life sciences industry dynamics, including R&amp;amp;D workflows, clinical development, drug commercialization, regulatory affairs, and digital transformation initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience navigating lengthy procurement cycles and multi-stakeholder decision processes within large, matrixed pharma organizations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established relationships with senior executives across R&amp;amp;D, IT, and commercial functions at major pharmaceutical and biotech companies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to translate technical AI capabilities into business value and ROI in a life sciences context&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience collaborating with technical teams to develop tailored solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, with the ability to engage credibly with both scientific and business audiences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with European data privacy and health data frameworks, including GDPR, the EU Health Data Space (EHDS) regulation, GxP requirements, and EMA guidance on AI/data-driven technologies&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£280,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£330,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brunswick is recruiting for an AI Enablement Specialist to join our pioneering AI Lab.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brunswick’s AI Lab serves as the firm’s central hub for AI innovation. The Lab researches, builds and maintains cutting-edge AI solutions, while partnering with client teams to provide advanced technical expertise on complex mandates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As AI adoption accelerates across the firm, the Lab plays a critical role in ensuring Brunswick remains at the forefront of AI-enabled advisory work and equipping our teams with the tools, skills and confidence to deliver differentiated value to clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is focused on enabling people across the firm to use AI tools confidently,&amp;nbsp;effectively&amp;nbsp;and responsibly. It combines training delivery, content creation, tool evaluation, hands-on support, and close engagement with teams to embed AI into day-to-day workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will work closely with Partners, Directors and teams globally to drive adoption and ensure AI tools deliver tangible business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your day-to-day responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading adoption,&amp;nbsp;embedding&amp;nbsp;and providing user support&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed within teams for defined periods to help them integrate AI tools into live client work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify barriers to adoption and work with the AI Lab to address them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track recurring issues and feedback themes to inform training, documentation and product improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give input into the overall AI adoption plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as first-line support for AI tools, answering user queries and troubleshooting common issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide practical guidance on effective prompting and workflow integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adoption and training&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver structured AI training programmes, including:&amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-person workshops and office sessions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Virtual training sessions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Written guidance and internal communications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recorded training videos&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create&amp;nbsp;clear, practical materials that translate technical capabilities into relevant business use cases, presented in language that will resonate with&amp;nbsp;different audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive internal adoption campaigns to increase awareness, confidence and usage of approved AI tools.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel to Brunswick offices to deliver training and support local&amp;nbsp;AI&amp;nbsp;embedding efforts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool Evaluation and Selection&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the evaluation of emerging AI tools, including hands-on testing and business relevance assessment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather structured feedback from users to inform tool selection,&amp;nbsp;prioritisation, and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide input into decisions on tool rollout, retirement, and optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with developments across the generative AI landscape (e.g. ChatGPT, GPTs, Claude and related tools) and assess their relevance to the firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will combine&amp;nbsp;strong communication&amp;nbsp;skills, curiosity about both business and technology, and the ability to&amp;nbsp;operate&amp;nbsp;effectively in ambiguous environments.&amp;nbsp;They will be comfortable moving between strategic conversations with senior stakeholders and hands-on practical support with end users.&amp;nbsp;Standout candidates demonstrate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using generative AI tools (e.g., ChatGPT, GPTs, Claude) in a professional setting with a strong understanding of where they add value and where they don’t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written communication skills and able to translate complex ideas into clear, concise, actionable guidance that people can immediately apply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation skills, including developing high-quality PowerPoint materials and delivering engaging sessions to senior audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with senior stakeholders, with the ability to flex your style and messaging depending on the audience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience evaluating digital tools or technology solutions, with sound judgement about business impact, risks, and practical implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural ability to bring structure to ambiguity and turning broad business challenges into practical workflows, tools, and guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working independently, taking ownership, and rolling up your sleeves to get things done in fast-moving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High emotional intelligence and genuine curiosity about how people and teams work, and how to help them work better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally to deliver training and embed within teams when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in professional services or advisory environments would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you are joining a client facing team, a core services team, or starting out on your professional career journey, joining Brunswick unlocks a range of employee benefits to support your financial future, health and wellness, family and community and continuous professional development.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;About Brunswick&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Brunswick is a global advisory firm. We help companies tackle high-stakes issues, navigate complex stakeholder relationships, and deliver high-impact outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our clients value our ability to anticipate, shape, and respond to the key players and forces in the financial and investment arena, regulatory and geopolitical universe, NGO community, workforce and beyond. They rely on us for deep experience, fresh perspectives and original thinking. So, in Brunswick you will find an exceptional range of experience and talent with a rich mix of backgrounds. From the beginning, we have prioritized attracting, developing, and retaining the best professionals in the industry, united by a culture of inclusivity, excellence, and intellectual curiosity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 1987 in London, the firm has organically grown to 27 offices in 18 countries across the Americas, Europe, Middle East, Africa, Asia and Australia. We operate as a “one-firm firm” with no individual profit centers. This allows us to assemble fully integrated, bespoke teams for each client, able to draw on the full resources of Brunswick anywhere in the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Brunswick is an equal opportunity employer. &amp;nbsp;All qualified applicants will be considered without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, disability, pregnancy, genetic information, or any other status protected by applicable law. Please&amp;nbsp;read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.brunswickgroup.com/app/uploads/Group-Privacy-Notice-for-Employees_April-2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; to understand how your data is managed.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Join Our Global Recruitment Team as a Talent Acquisition Associate, EMEA, based out of Manchester. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;279&quot; data-end=&quot;416&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Guidepoint is expanding into &lt;strong data-start=&quot;308&quot; data-end=&quot;322&quot;&gt;Manchester&lt;/strong&gt;, and we&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;348&quot; data-end=&quot;380&quot;&gt;Talent Acquisition Associate&lt;/strong&gt; to help build our newest UK office.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;418&quot; data-end=&quot;800&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a unique opportunity to play a key role in our growth, supporting end-to-end recruitment while helping establish Guidepoint&#39;s UK campus recruitment programme from the ground up. Working alongside our global Talent Acquisition team, you&#39;ll partner with hiring managers, build relationships with leading universities and help attract exceptional talent across the EMEA region.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;802&quot; data-end=&quot;958&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;812&quot; data-end=&quot;847&quot;&gt;hybrid role based in Manchester&lt;/strong&gt;. While our permanent office is being finalised, you&#39;ll initially work from a temporary workspace and remotely.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;960&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;All applicants must have the right to work in the UK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;v5cssg&quot; data-start=&quot;1020&quot; data-end=&quot;1032&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;1034&quot; data-end=&quot;1221&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Talent Acquisition Associate, you&#39;ll manage full-cycle recruitment across graduate, corporate and business hiring while supporting the continued growth of Guidepoint&#39;s UK operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-start=&quot;1223&quot; data-end=&quot;1536&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll partner with hiring managers to deliver recruitment strategies, build strong talent pipelines and provide an exceptional candidate experience. Alongside business-as-usual recruitment, you&#39;ll play a key role in developing our UK campus recruitment programme and representing Guidepoint at university events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
